      [
        "One line to install",
        "The installer writes a single binary, with no separate engine or TUI. macOS, Linux and Windows.",
      ],
    ],
    miaoBlurb:
      "Reads the repo, edits the code, runs the commands, checks the result. You pick the model, and every turn is on the record.",
