    installMeta: "macOS · Linux · Windows",
    downloadHead: "Get mtty",
    download: "Download the preview",
    downloadMeta: "macOS · Linux · Windows · preview",
    copyLabel: "Copy command",
    shotMtty: "Current mtty example workspace with a session sidebar, Markdown editor, Mermaid preview and a split terminal.",
    shotMiao: "Current miao example session with an inline edit diff, response and context telemetry.",
    capMtty: "mtty · editor, preview, terminal and agent state",
    capMiao: "miao · tasks, changes, tools and context (example session)",
    productsLabel: "the products",
    productsH: "Two independent projects.",
    miaoKind: "Coding agent",
    miaoH: "Start with the context.",
    miaoPoints: [
      ["Nothing extra in context", "The system-context baseline stays fixed and changes are appended in order, so the provider keeps hitting its prompt cache across turns."],
      ["Compact before it fills", "Compaction starts before the window fills, and the summary reuses the current request prefix. Old tool output is pruned by default; the full result stays on disk."],
      ["Every turn is on the record", "Per-turn tokens, cache-hit rate, time to first token and estimated cost. Budgets cover money, tokens, turns and time."],
      ["One line is enough", "The installer writes only miao, with no engine or TUI beside it. One command covers macOS, Linux and Windows."],
    ],
    miaoMeta: "Single binary · Rust accelerators · MIT",
    miaoMore: "Explore miao",
    mttyKind: "Terminal · editor · agents",
    mttyH: "Terminal, editor, agents: one window.",
    mttyPoints: [
      ["Rendered on the GPU", "Redraws follow what changed, and measured budgets keep the frame cost honest."],
      ["A workspace, not just a window", "Tabs, recursive splits, quick file navigation and native editor panes with syntax highlighting, language servers and live previews."],
      ["It can read an agent", "Pane badges, notifications, a sleep guard and a prompt queue, all driven by agent state."],
      ["Remote hosts, local folders", "A host library, keys, SFTP, port forwarding, jump hosts and snippets over your own OpenSSH."],
    ],
    mttyMeta: "Rust · Apache-2.0 · pre-release",
    mttyMore: "Explore mtty",
    togetherLabel: "better together",
    togetherH: "Four agents running. None of them watched.",
    togetherLede:
      "Inside an mtty pane, miao reports its state over the terminal's control plane. mtty badges the pane, notifies you when an agent needs an answer, keeps the machine awake while it works, and sends your queued prompt the moment it goes idle.",
    togetherFine:
      "Neither needs the other. Outside mtty the report does nothing; with no agent reporting, mtty is just a terminal. State hooks for other agent CLIs are included.",
